"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A programa\u00e7\u00e3o abre no s\u00e1bado (6 de mar\u00e7o, \u00e0s 15h00) com o <strong>Kids Trail das Amendoeiras<\/strong> (gratuito, para crian\u00e7as e jovens dos 4 aos 15 anos em dist\u00e2ncias de 400 m a 2.000 m). No domingo (7 de mar\u00e7o), disputam-se o <strong>Trail de 25 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong>09h30<\/strong>) e o <strong>Trail Sprint de 14 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong>09h35<\/strong>) \u2014 ambos integrados no Circuito Regional de Trail 2026\/2027 da AAVR e com pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios para o Top 3 Geral M\/F \u2014, acompanhados pela <strong>Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09h45<\/strong> pelos trilhos e miradouros das amendoeiras em flor. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 