 11px;\"> (03\/11\/2026 a 28\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 07 Mar \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:45<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Geral (Almo\u00e7o opcional: +10,00 \u20ac):<\/strong> 10,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (03\/11\/2026 a 28\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Kids Trail das Amendoeiras (4 aos 15 anos \u2014 S\u00e1bado 06\/03)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 06 Mar \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 15:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Gratuita (c\/ autoriza\u00e7\u00e3o parental):<\/strong> 0,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 28\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Trail das Amendoeiras Durius Pesqueira 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As provas principais realizam-se no domingo, 7 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, na Estrada N222-3 (em frente ao Tribunal Judicial de S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Pesqueira, distrito de Viseu): Trail 25 km \u00e0s 09h30, Trail Sprint 14 km \u00e0s 09h35 e Caminhada 10 km \u00e0s 09h45. O Kids Trail realiza-se na v\u00e9spera, s\u00e1bado, 6 de mar\u00e7o, \u00e0s 15h00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e at\u00e9 quando me posso inscrever?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem de 3 de novembro de 2026 a 28 de fevereiro de 2027 com os seguintes valores: Trail 25 km por 12,00 \u20ac, Trail Sprint 14 km por 10,00 \u20ac, Caminhada 10 km por 10,00 \u20ac e Kids Trail gratuito (0,00 \u20ac). O almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio na Escola EB 2,3 tem o custo opcional de 10,00 \u20ac (gratuito at\u00e9 aos 10 anos).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando funciona o secretariado da prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No s\u00e1bado, 6 de mar\u00e7o, o secretariado do Kids Trail abre \u00e0s 14h00 e o secretariado geral funciona das 16h00 \u00e0s 19h00 na Rua Dr. Francisco S\u00e1 Carneiro, n.\u00ba 41. No domingo, 7 de mar\u00e7o, funciona junto \u00e0 partida (Estrada N222-3) das 07h30 \u00e0s 09h00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existem pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios no Trail 25 km e no Trail Sprint 14 km?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, em ambas as provas competitivas (25 km e 14 km) os 3 primeiros classificados da geral masculina e feminina recebem Trof\u00e9u + 50 \u20ac (1\u00ba), Trof\u00e9u + 30 \u20ac (2\u00ba) e Trof\u00e9u + 20 \u20ac (3\u00ba), al\u00e9m de trof\u00e9us por escal\u00e3o (Sub-23 a M\/F 65) e pr\u00e9mios para as 3 melhores equipas.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e o equipamento obrigat\u00f3rio?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O fecho de controlo de tempos ocorre \u00e0s 14h00 (m\u00e1ximo de 4h30 de prova). Os atletas do Trail e Trail Sprint devem transportar obrigatoriamente telem\u00f3vel com bateria, manta t\u00e9rmica e recipiente pr\u00f3prio de hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o (sistema de auto-sufici\u00eancia nos abastecimentos).<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail das Amendoeiras Durius Pesqueira 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-03-06\", \"endDate\": \"2027-03-06\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Estrada N222-3 (em frente ao Tribunal Judicial), S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Pesqueira\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Pesqueira\", \"addressRegion\": \"Viseu\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O VI Trail das Amendoeiras Durius Pesqueira 2027 realiza-se a 6 e 7 de mar\u00e7o em S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Pesqueira com 25 km, 14 km, Caminhada 10 km e Kids Trail. Inscreve-te!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-das-amendoeiras.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail das Amendoeiras 25 km (Circuito AAVR)\", \"price\": \"12.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/trail-das-amendoeiras-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Sprint 14 km (Circuito AAVR)\", \"price\": \"10.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/trail-das-amendoeiras-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada 10 km\", \"price\": \"10.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/trail-das-amendoeiras-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Kids Trail das Amendoeiras (4 aos 15 anos \u2014 S\u00e1bado 06\/03)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/trail-das-amendoeiras-2027\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"DURIUS Atl\u00e9tico Clube da Pesqueira\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Trail das Amendoeiras Durius Pesqueira 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As provas principais realizam-se no domingo, 7 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, na Estrada N222-3 (em frente ao Tribunal Judicial de S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Pesqueira, distrito de Viseu): Trail 25 km \u00e0s 09h30, Trail Sprint 14 km \u00e0s 09h35 e Caminhada 10 km \u00e0s 09h45. O Kids Trail realiza-se na v\u00e9spera, s\u00e1bado, 6 de mar\u00e7o, \u00e0s 15h00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e at\u00e9 quando me posso inscrever?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem de 3 de novembro de 2026 a 28 de fevereiro de 2027 com os seguintes valores: Trail 25 km por 12,00 \u20ac, Trail Sprint 14 km por 10,00 \u20ac, Caminhada 10 km por 10,00 \u20ac e Kids Trail gratuito (0,00 \u20ac). O almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio na Escola EB 2,3 tem o custo opcional de 10,00 \u20ac (gratuito at\u00e9 aos 10 anos).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando funciona o secretariado da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No s\u00e1bado, 6 de mar\u00e7o, o secretariado do Kids Trail abre \u00e0s 14h00 e o secretariado geral funciona das 16h00 \u00e0s 19h00 na Rua Dr. Francisco S\u00e1 Carneiro, n.\u00ba 41. No domingo, 7 de mar\u00e7o, funciona junto \u00e0 partida (Estrada N222-3) das 07h30 \u00e0s 09h00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Existem pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios no Trail 25 km e no Trail Sprint 14 km?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, em ambas as provas competitivas (25 km e 14 km) os 3 primeiros classificados da geral masculina e feminina recebem Trof\u00e9u + 50 \u20ac (1\u00ba), Trof\u00e9u + 30 \u20ac (2\u00ba) e Trof\u00e9u + 20 \u20ac (3\u00ba), al\u00e9m de trof\u00e9us por escal\u00e3o (Sub-23 a M\/F 65) e pr\u00e9mios para as 3 melhores equipas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e o equipamento obrigat\u00f3rio?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O fecho de controlo de tempos ocorre \u00e0s 14h00 (m\u00e1ximo de 4h30 de prova). Os atletas do Trail e Trail Sprint devem transportar obrigatoriamente telem\u00f3vel com bateria, manta t\u00e9rmica e recipiente pr\u00f3prio de hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o (sistema de auto-sufici\u00eancia nos abastecimentos).\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":71303,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":